// Cyrus v5 forge stream (handoff START-HERE §6): NDJSON GenEvents.
//  - A prompt that routes to a game Cyrus really builds for (Minecraft), or a change to one of the
//    account's real mods, starts a REAL build through lib/modbuilder/create.ts (the same
//    validation, rate limits and token gate as POST /api/mod-builder/builds) and streams its real
//    progress and code (lib/cyrus/follow.ts). Token errors answer JSON (402/403/429 + code)
//    BEFORE the stream starts, for cyrusTokens.handleBuildError().
//  - Every other game has no builder yet: the handoff's TEMPLATE generator (forgeStream) runs,
